*land_cg2
[setreplay name="land001" storage="SundayDate/SundayDate_Land002.ks" target="replay_land"]
;FG003_6.png
[mask time="500" effect="fadeIn" ]
[chara_hide_all time="1" ]
[playbgm2 volume="40"  time="1000"  loop="true"  fadein="false"  storage="BGM0_title.mp3"  html5="false"  ]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/00.png" time="500"   ]
[if exp="!f.flag_replay" ]
    [setTime minutes="0" hours="15"]
[endif]
[mask_off time="500" effect="fadeOut" ]



[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0049.mp3"  ]
[messageON]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
おいしいですね、先生！[r]
こんなタイミングの間食、ドキドキします[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/01.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0050.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
……その、突き出している手は？[r]
え？　あーん？[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/02.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0051.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
わ、わたしが食べさせてもらうんですか！？[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[image layer="1" storage="../bgimage/bk100.jpg" time="1000" ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0052.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
あ、あーん……[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/03.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0053.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
ん……
ありが、とう、ございます……[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/00.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0054.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
先生の方も、なんだか真っ赤、ですけど[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/04.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0055.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
あ、はい……[r]
やってみたら自分も恥ずかしかった……と[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/00.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0056.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
すごく小さいときに家族にお世話されてたころ[r]
みたいなものですしね[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/05.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0057.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
でも、昔のことを思い返すのもいいのかも――[r]
わたし、先のことばかり考えてたみたいで[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/04.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0058.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
先生と過ごすのは楽しいけれど、いつまでも[r]
お邪魔し続けるのは先生に悪いなぁって[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/06.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0059.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
わたしのせいで先生がきゅうくつな思いをしてたら[r]
申し訳ないし、それが続くかもって焦ってて……[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/05.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0060.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
でも、こうやって日曜日にいっしょに遠出して、[r]
お話ししてゆったり過ごすのを先生はしてくれて[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/03.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0061.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
そんな時間の使い方が、すごく贅沢だなって思えて[r]
なんだか納得できたんです[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/00.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0062.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
いつかも、もしかしたら、も[r]
不安に思い始めたらきりがないから[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/05.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0063.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
一日一日をだいじに、先のことばかりじゃなくて、[r]
今のこの時間を考えればいいんだ――[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/03.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0064.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
しぜんと、そんなふうに気が楽になりました[r]
ありがとうございます、先生[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/07.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0065.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
お礼に、わたしからもお返しです[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/08.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0066.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
はい、あーん[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[CGSet layer="1" storage="EVcg/DateLand/09.png" time="500"   ]
[playse  volume="100"  time="1000"  buf="2"  storage="vo_scene/FT_m003_Date_0067.mp3"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=3 ]
#みお
ふふっ、たのしい[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[eval exp="f.dateSuccess.land = true" ]
[messageInvisible]
[fadeinbgm2 volume="40"  time="3000"  loop="true"  fadein="false"  storage=&f.beforeBGM  html5="false"  ]
[endreplay]
[return]

;回想シーン用
*replay_land
[button name="myButton" fix="true" target="endReplay"  storage="macro_call.ks" enterimg="osawari/modoru_2.png"  graphic="osawari/modoru.png"  width="38"  height="38"  x="1249"  y="15"  cond="f.flag_replay"  ]
[replaySituSelect column="1" text="&tf.text"]

[setGlinkY num="2"]

[glink  color="btn_05_black"  text="初回時の内容"  _clickable_img="" target="*replay_land_check" size="24" x="auto"   y="&tf.glink1Y"  width="500"  height=""  preexp="0"  exp="f.isAwake = false,tf.situText1='初回時の内容',tf.storage='SundayDate/SundayDate_Land002.ks',tf.label='land_cg2'"  clickse="se/s_kettei.mp3"   ]
[glink  color="btn_05_black" text="２回目以降の内容"  target="replay_land_check" size="24" x="auto"  y="&tf.glink2Y"  width="500"  height=""  preexp="0" exp="tf.situText1='２回目以降の内容',tf.storage='SundayDate/SundayDate_Land003.ks',tf.label='land_cg3'"  clickse="se/s_kettei.mp3"   ]
[s]
[s]

*replay_land_check
[columnUpdate column="1" text="&tf.situText1"]
[replaySituCheck]
[if exp="tf.isSituOK" ]
    [deleteSituColumn]
    [setButtonInTalk]
    [jump target="&tf.label" storage="&tf.storage"  ]
[else]
    [jump target="*replay_land" ]
[endif]

[endreplay]
